{"version":1,"key":"card:412","content":{"id":412,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"做笔记的一些误区：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e7876aad-87ca-4881-951f-589bd8095b02","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"完美主义：认为笔记做完后是不用修改的，直接可用的，实际上笔记是要一直迭代的，真正重要的是快速写下自己的想法，至于排版、美化、遣词造句都是后续的工作","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"af588fde-9917-4b22-837a-26c34a75491a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4109162d-8201-4250-accb-af0582334a6f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"没有目的：没有审查已有的知识体系，没有目的的进行输入，使得接收的信息无法有效的融入到已有的知识体系结构，给出两个寻找信息的思路","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1a690f99-7232-45bc-b9ff-c6a8257918d9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"根据正在做的项目，有目的的收集该项目需要的信息，整理归类","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"94cf45f2-5869-42f5-af62-c9758c66f0e2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"6e73e400-0ac5-4878-884d-567befb91595","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"审查已有的知识体系结构，看看哪里不清楚、不明白、不深入、不知道，主动地去收集相关信息，查漏补缺","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4a1a9135-a253-4659-918a-df79577728f7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"448374c4-2588-411f-854a-87c6adaaab89","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"b642f83d-c4d6-4830-a69d-71ea007a9eb1","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"总而言之，要有目的，不能一头扎进无序的信息中，要有目的的寻找我们需要的信息，完善我们的笔记系统、知识体系","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b70f8b88-f22a-4b28-8b36-d1e804dc8985","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"e01cd1c5-ae08-4e1d-806d-ba50ef48afec","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"c40d853c-a276-41b6-b362-0bc1f81eaeb7","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["笔记系统"],"createTime":1710983513644,"updateTime":1793532524507,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532524507}}